@startuml
' Registro, inicio de sesión y carga del usuario.
' Fuente: modules/auth (AuthController, AuthService, JwtStrategy).
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam ParticipantPadding 20
skinparam BoxPadding 10

actor "Jugador" as Player
participant "LP-MOB" as Mobile
participant "AuthController" as AuthController
participant "AuthService" as AuthService
participant "AWS Cognito" as Cognito
database "PostgreSQL" as DB

== Registro ==
Player -> Mobile: Correo, nickname y contraseña
Mobile -> AuthController: POST /auth/signUp
AuthController -> AuthService: signUp(dto)
AuthService -> DB: ¿existe el correo?
AuthService -> Cognito: SignUp (username = uuid)
AuthService -> Cognito: AdminAddUserToGroup(PLAYER)
AuthService -> DB: INSERT user (id = uuid, rol PLAYER)
alt falla después de crear en Cognito
  AuthService -> Cognito: AdminDeleteUser (compensación)
  AuthService --> AuthController: 500
end
AuthController --> Mobile: userSub + mensaje de verificación

== Inicio de sesión ==
Player -> Mobile: Correo y contraseña
Mobile -> AuthController: POST /auth/signIn
AuthController -> AuthService: signIn(dto)
AuthService -> Cognito: InitiateAuth (USER_PASSWORD_AUTH)
Cognito --> AuthService: access, id y refresh token
AuthService --> Mobile: tokens
Mobile -> AuthController: GET /auth/me (Bearer access token)
note right of AuthController: JwtAuthGuard valida el JWT de Cognito\n(token_use = access y client_id)
AuthController -> AuthService: me(sub)
AuthService -> DB: user + avatar
AuthService --> Mobile: usuario (avatar con URL firmada)
Mobile --> Player: MainTabs según el rol

== Renovación ==
Mobile -> AuthController: POST /auth/refresh-token
AuthController -> AuthService: refreshToken(token)
AuthService -> Cognito: InitiateAuth (REFRESH_TOKEN_AUTH)
AuthService --> Mobile: tokens nuevos

@enduml
